  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Shroomcraft</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 擴展了 Minecraft 的真菌家族，新增了多種蘑菇類型、可愛生物和植被，為蘑菇島帶來全新生機。探索橙色、紫色和藍色蘑菇，它們與經典的棕色和紅色蘑菇一同生長，從微小嫩芽到高聳巨菇應有盡有。每種蘑菇都配有相應的木材、方塊和裝飾，為建築師提供豐富的色彩和紋理選擇，打造溫馨建築和生動景觀。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">島上的生命從未如此活躍。哞菇現在以各種新顏色出現，還有背上長著蘑菇的古怪雞隻：蘑菇雞。您甚至可能在附近水域遇到稀有的蘑菇鰭魚。地表之下，發光的菌絲生長照亮洞穴，孢子可製成蘑菇炸彈，增添一點額外的惡作劇樂趣。在您專屬的蘑菇天堂中探索、建造與茁壯成長。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🍄 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新蘑菇種類：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 橙色、紫色和藍色蘑菇與經典的棕色和紅色蘑菇一同生長。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌳 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">蘑菇木材：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 每種蘑菇類型都有完整的木材套組，供創意建築使用。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🐄 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">哞菇變種：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 獨特的蘑菇牛，對應五種主世界和兩種地獄真菌。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🐔 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">蘑菇雞：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 背上長著蘑菇的雞隻，和平生活在蘑菇島上。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🐟 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">蘑菇鰭魚：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 在蘑菇島及其周邊水域發現的新魚種。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">蘑菇嫩芽：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 各種顏色的小型植被，為您的島嶼增添細節。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">蘑菇炸彈：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 可投擲的孢子，釋放持續性有害效果。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌌 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">菌絲生長：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 發光的洞穴真菌，像發光地衣一樣照亮地下。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌾 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">小型蘑菇：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 從孢子種植小型蘑菇，便於耕作。</span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需在客戶端安裝 &amp; 需在伺服器安裝</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（FABRIC 與 NEOFORGE）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（FABRIC）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（FABRIC）</span></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若模組支援，可直接在遊戲中使用模組選單進行配置（需在 Fabric 上安裝 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，由 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProspector\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 開發）。請注意，在舊版 Minecraft 中還需安裝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若使用外部文字編輯器進行手動配置，所有檔案位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 資料夾中，命名為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，依配置類型而定。模組可能不存在所有類型，或完全沒有配置檔案。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">特別感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/dayiel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Dayiel</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 出色的 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shroomed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Shroomed</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 模組，其迷人的資源幫助塑造了本專案的外觀與感覺。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">萬分感謝才華橫溢的 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mim1q\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">mim1q</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，創作了令人驚艷、充滿活力的紋理，賦予本模組生動的魅力。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/illager-invasion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/metal-bundles\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easymagic/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/betteranimationscollection/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchanting-infuser\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hopper-gadgetry\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/hoppergadgetry/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/leaves-be-gone\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/leavesbegone/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/death-finder\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/deathfinder/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cut-through\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/cutthrough/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/",
